      "problem": "Simplify ${csc}^{4}⁡\\theta -{cot}^{4}⁡\\theta -2{cot}^{2}⁡\\theta .$",
      "worked_solution": "First, let's recall the following identity:\n\n$$\n{cot}^{2}⁡\\theta ={csc}^{2}⁡\\theta -1\n$$\n\nSubstituting the above identity into the given expression, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{csc}^{4}⁡\\theta -{cot}^{4}⁡\\theta -2{cot}^{2}⁡\\theta  & ={csc}^{4}⁡\\theta -{({cot}^{2}⁡\\theta )}^{2}-2{cot}^{2}⁡\\theta  \\\\  & ={csc}^{4}⁡\\theta -({csc}^{2}⁡\\theta -1)^{2}-2({csc}^{2}⁡\\theta -1) \\\\  & ={csc}^{4}⁡\\theta -({csc}^{4}⁡\\theta -2{csc}^{2}⁡\\theta +1)-2{csc}^{2}⁡\\theta +2 \\\\  & ={csc}^{4}⁡\\theta -{csc}^{4}⁡\\theta +2{csc}^{2}⁡\\theta -1-2{csc}^{2}⁡\\theta +2 \\\\  & =\\cancel{{csc}^{4}⁡\\theta }-\\cancel{{csc}^{4}⁡\\theta }+\\cancel{2{csc}^{2}⁡\\theta }-1-\\cancel{2{csc}^{2}⁡\\theta }+2 \\\\  & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
